    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-data-type-conversion:app:narrative:guide:working-with-type-conversion" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-data-type-conversion:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-data-type-conversion:app:narrative:summary:summary">
      <Body>`MetaDataTypeConversion` records how declared types move between systems. A conversion names the source and target systems and the length, precision, scale, fallback, and compatibility rules for that boundary.

Transform binding and conversion tools use this workspace as shared policy. The policy stays separate from the models that consume it, so a platform mapping can change without changing the business model.</Body>
